lɛ, ben à bↄ̀ ń saɛ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vĩa ń kũ, ben aↄ̃ bàa lɛ̀.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Gwen aↄ̃ↄe lugaan","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"lán nↄgbɛ̃ nↄ̀wãwãkɛri bà.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"N ń wiwi","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"lán ↄfãntɛ̃bↄɛ ĩa è latarinↄ góro'itɛnↄ wíwi nà.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Yã kɛ̀ wá màn wa wɛ́ɛ è","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Dii Zĩ̀kpɛde wa Luda wɛ́tɛ guu.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Luda wɛ́tɛ pì kàɛ àgↄ̃ kuu gurↄ píngi.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Luda, wá kú n kpɛ́ ua,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"wée laasuu lɛɛ n yenzikɛɛa.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Luda, lán n tↄ́ dàgula ai anduna lɛ́n nà,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"lɛn n sáabukpana dàgula lɛ dↄ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nɛɛ̀ yã gↄ̃gↄ̃ n gbɛ̃nↄnɛ a zɛ́a.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Zayↄn kpiideenↄↄ e pↄnnaa kɛɛ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Yudanↄ bùsu wɛ́tɛdeenↄ pↄↄ kɛ̀ nna,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"yãkpaɛ kɛ̀ ń kɛ̀nↄ yãnzi.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"À dↄdↄkↄ̃zi à liga Zayↄnzi,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"à à bĩi dãkpaki lezĩ pariinↄ naro.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"À à bĩinↄ tàasi kɛ kↄ̃n à zɛki gbãaanↄ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"lɛ à e à tↄ̃kɛ̃ kpɛɛdeenↄnɛ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Zaakɛ Luda kɛ̀n wa Luda ũ gurↄ píngi,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"è dↄwe aɛ ai wà gá gáo gákiiamɛ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/bus_sim/PSA/48.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/bus_sim/PSA/49.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/bus_sim/PSA/47.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}